{
  "dom_id": "questionExplanation-73216",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "To find the trace in the $yz$-plane, we substitute $x=0$ into the equation of the ellipsoid:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{0}^{2}}{8}+\\frac{(y+1)^{2}}{6}+\\frac{(z-1)^{2}}{12}=1 \\\\ \\frac{(y+1)^{2}}{6}+\\frac{(z-1)^{2}}{12}=1 \\\\ \\frac{(y+1)^{2}}{(\\sqrt{6})^{2}}+\\frac{(z-1)^{2}}{(2\\sqrt{3})^{2}}=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of the ellipse with semi-axes $\\sqrt{6}$ and $2\\sqrt{3},$ centered at $(-1,1)$ in the $yz$-plane.",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
